       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINO-SMOOTH.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KINO-SMOOTH-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GRADIENT-LIMIT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NOISE-REJECT-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPECKLE-CONTRAST-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SMOOTH-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SMOOTH-SEAL-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KINO-SMOOTH-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PPS-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PPS-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GRAD-AND-NOISE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SPECKLE-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PPS-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GRAD-AND-NOISE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRADIENT-LIMIT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NOISE-REJECT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SPECKLE-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPECKLE-CONTRAST-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SMOOTH-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PPS-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GRADIENT-LIMIT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NOISE-REJECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPECKLE-CONTRAST-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SMOOTH-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SMOOTH-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PPS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PPS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PPS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PPS-CODE.
